repository-code: "https://github.com/yuhanlydia/speech-negotiation-kv"
url: "https://github.com/yuhanlydia/speech-negotiation-kv"
abstract: >-
  Research implementation and recorded result summaries for matched-content
  decomposition of paralinguistic variation in a frozen speech language model.
  ParaGeo combines audio-token replay, K/V pooling, within-content centering,
  a shared low-rank basis, and content-associated projection. The repository
  separates fixed-basis representation probes from generation interventions.
keywords:
  - paralinguistic representation
  - speech language models
  - latent geometry
  - activation steering
  - reproducibility
